nter;\">01</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\">Assistant Professor (Yogik Vigyan)</td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\">01</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>MPPSC Assistant Professor Bharti 2025 : Educational Qualification</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates having Post Graduate (PG) Degree in the Related Subject with 55% Marks from any recognized university / college will be considered for this post.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">UGC / CSIR NET / SLTE / SET Exam Passed</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">All candidates must read the official information completely before applying.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>MPPSC Assistant Professor Online Form 2025 : How To Apply</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates can apply through link https://mppsc.mp.gov.in/ or provided below in link section or they can also apply through official site of the MPPSC before Last Date.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">You Can Check other <a style=\"color: #000000;\" href=\"https://www.sarkariexam.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Sarkari Result 2025</a> Notification Here – <a style=\"color: #000000;\" href=\"https://www.sarkariexam.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Check Now.</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">For all the interested and eligible candidates who want to apply for MPPSC Assistant Professor recruitment can read all the information related to the recruitment is given below and the link to apply is given in the Important Link section below.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>MPPSC Assistant Professor Recruitment 2025 : Mode of Selection</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Screening Test</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Subject Knowledge Test</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Interview (Viva-Voce)</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Document Verification</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Medical Examination</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[adinserter block=”3″]</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable2\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><strong>Follow SarkariExam on Instagram</strong></span></td>\n<td class=\"post-social-link\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"3\" data-align=\"center\"><strong></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><b>Join Our WhatsApp Channel</b></span></td>\n<td class=\"post-social-link\" style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"3\" data-align=\"center\"><strong><a href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Follow Now</a></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; padding: 0px;\" colspan=\"7\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3><strong>Important Links</strong></h3>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tcell\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"56%\">\n<h4><span style=\"color: #800000;\"><strong>Apply Online</strong></span></h4>\n</td>\n<td class=\"tcell\" colspan=\"4\" wid